{"DualWriterMode3.Create records legacy duration when Storage.Create fails, so storage failure telemetry is missing and the legacy histogram is polluted": 0.9581118226051331, "DualWriterMode3.Delete records the object name into the metrics label that is defined as 'kind', creating unbounded time-series cardinality which can degrade Prometheus performance and makes the metric semantically incorrect": 0.9492102861404419, "DualWriterMode3.Update passes the same UpdatedObjectInfo to both Storage.Update and Legacy.Update, causing UpdatedObjectInfo.UpdatedObject to be applied twice against potentially different old objects, resulting in legacy persisting different content than unified storage": 0.6760691404342651, "TestMode3_Create's error case mocks Legacy.Create failing, but Mode3.Create calls Storage.Create first; without a Storage.Create expectation returning an error, the test will fail with an unexpected mock invocation": 0.9201905727386475, "TestMode3_Delete does not set an expectation for Legacy.Delete, but Mode3.Delete always calls Legacy.Delete asynchronously after a successful Storage.Delete, causing unexpected mock calls and likely panics": 0.9820241928100586, "TestMode3_DeleteCollection does not set an expectation for Legacy.DeleteCollection, but Mode3.DeleteCollection calls Legacy.DeleteCollection asynchronously after a successful storage delete-collection, triggering unexpected mock calls": 0.9861564636230469, "DualWriterMode3.Update records legacy duration when Storage.Update fails, so storage update failure telemetry is lost and failures appear under the legacy histogram instead of storage": 0.9989736080169678, "DualWriterMode3.DeleteCollection records a storage duration metric for the legacy async delete-collection operation, preventing legacy duration from being tracked and polluting the storage-duration histogram with legacy timings": 0.9902808666229248}